<p>Each time one of your stone vines deals damage to a creature it will restore <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.3, 0.6, 0.9, 1.1, 1.3</acronym> equilibrium and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.4, 0.8, 1.2, 1.4, 1.7</acronym> mana.</p><p>Your vines also become infused with eldritch energies, dealing an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">29, 38, 45, 50, 55</acronym> arcane damage.</p>